    "summary": "getLanceConn refuses the live ~/.insrc/lance with LanceStoreNotOwnerError before creating or connecting unless the process declared itself the owner (isLiveStoreOwnerDeclared in the graph store module); the graph store's temporary reader allowance does not open the vector store, as the design says. An audit found ten test files opening the live vector store; all now use a temporary one. Because the MCP server's in-process analysis is now refused the vector store until t9 moves it into the daemon, none of this Story is pushed before t9.",
